<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Chico's upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Chico's upgraded to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon Read &amp; Co Inc analyst Peter Schaeffer said he upgraded Chico's FAS Inc to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>&quot;The company finally seems to have conquered the turmoil which has marred performance over the past 30 months,&quot; Schaeffer said.</p>
<p>Shares in the retailer closed Monday at 4-3/4 in over-the-counter trading.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
